      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Do not directly dismiss their foundational belief in shareholder value, as this will only solidify their opposition. Instead, you must *redefine* \"shareholder value\" to explicitly *include* strong ESG performance as a risk-mitigation and value-creation strategy.\n\nFrame strong social and climate action not as a cost, but as a superior form of **fiduciary duty** that directly enhances the bottom line through superior risk management, better talent attraction, and access to capital in the modern, responsible investment landscape.",
